# Only newly introduced evidence is byte-preserved across LF/CRLF checkouts.
# Existing certified M1 migration attributes/content are untouched.
# Historical SQL and unified-diff context preserve source whitespace, including
# EOF blank lines and the single-space prefix on blank context lines.
supabase/provenance/** -text whitespace=-blank-at-eof,-blank-at-eol
supabase/replay-forms/** -text whitespace=-blank-at-eof
supabase/frontier/** -text whitespace=-blank-at-eof,-blank-at-eol
